## Post-execution verification (v22.2 — fails loudly if agent didn't actually run)

After executing ANY agent trigger from this file, you MUST verify the agent produced its expected outputs. If expected outputs are missing, emit a structured diagnostic so the user knows what went wrong and how to fix it.

