| review | Review report + **epic-context.md story entry** (compact summary with CREATED/MODIFIED/CONFIG files) + **review-gate build report** (only if Review ran its own build — skipped when Surgeon's report is fresh). Runs BEFORE Ship so next story has context even if Ship is deferred. | `$REVIEW_FILE` + `$EPIC_CONTEXT` (append) + `$REVIEW_BUILD_REPORT` (conditional) |
| ac-e2e-check | Demo/verify results + **demo-build report** (only if `run_build: true`) | `$DEMO_REPORT` + `$DEMO_BUILD_REPORT` (conditional) |
