| bundle-surgeon | Code changes (uncommitted) + consolidated Change Manifest with `Sources: <ticket-list>` per row + per-task build report. Checkpoints every 5 tasks. | Working dir + `$BUNDLE_MANIFEST_FILE` + `$SURGEON_BUILD_REPORT` (per-checkpoint) + `$BUNDLE_STATE_FILE` |
| bundle-review | Consolidated review with AC compliance grouped by source ticket; per-ticket sub-verdict + overall `Ship-ready: YES/NO/PARTIAL`. Appends per-ticket entries to `$EPIC_CONTEXT` story log. Checkpoints every 5 tasks. | `$BUNDLE_REVIEW_FILE` + `$EPIC_CONTEXT` (append per ticket) + `$BUNDLE_STATE_FILE` |
